The ⟪GTI18N_120c3fc9_000001⟫io⟪GTI18N_120c3fc9_000002⟫ package specifies the ⟪GTI18N_120c3fc9_000003⟫io.Reader⟪GTI18N_120c3fc9_000004⟫ interface,
